I have finished the third version of my queer characters patch. This patch
adds the 'queer' option. When enabled, foocubi can use their special
attack regardless of your gender. The patch also adds three conducts:
straight, gay, and celibate. To preserve the game balance as much as
possible, foocubi are twice as likely to develop severe headaches after an
encounter.

This version of the patch introduces the QUEER_KLUDGE compile time option.
If defined, bones will be compatible with vanilla NetHack (but savefiles
will not). There are also a few new games messages, as suggested by
Yashichi.

You can download the queer patch at
http://post.queensu.ca/~lehotay/nethack/

If everything works as expected, this will be the final version of this
patch. Please help me out by letting me know about any bugs or
irregularities you encounter. Thanks.

